<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta continues airstrikes, recently bombing a Karen village and damaging homes and vehicles, and it attacked two naval vessels on the Kaladan River, which were reported sunk. Thai troops fired warning shots after fighting damaged 20 Thai homes near the border. The regime imprisoned two Islamic teachers and seized a historic mosque, and four people were charged over a Molotov attack on a Myanmar refugee settlement. An ASEAN envoy is set to visit Myanmar. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNSWl4SlBja1R4RkhhaTMxemplMld0aldQMmlzbzdsOVlPMnJFWVNwRVVMa1dnanFtOVctTlEyWjl0SnI4Q3I4TzQ4QU5LRjRtX3BKSXc2RE5tQTNRSWhKYXlvX01QdE1OZWlQc1d4ZkZwWWxVQTVGLUR1NWFVWjZYcFNvNDJXS1hOYXUtVWRQSkdwMVZ5MGtUcHpjUTI3TjZ6M0VZaUdhLVdSTzA5UXkyYXlWUTFyRHlXb0tF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE8tWVd6bUotYTVGSzlmTURESXQ2SHhqLXdXMVRob01Da1hQTDVKbmtNUFNDSm1pU0l5cFlDSjFERk9ZMzdtbkpMc0pVdFVoMWVGM0JrcllmSW8xaDY2S0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOVGdSN0toZHZUdF83RzFxOXg0OU1zVkU1OFJpOTlFVGF5NmFTbWxsUENuNkR4X0tuLXVNSDEyREo0NVMtMGxpampQdDdQQzA4RUJpV3ppemYtR081ZXBOcXBoTVZ2VVNHMHFuOGk1cWxETk9TdG4zTHVuZlFjaVhZQlpnOVV1TzFzcXc5cWIwekkzcS16ek16Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOTFZYLWUyYmp2bDdldEZ1R192NndweTI4QjlRYUFSSngwR29yY25UWXdxaWhxajdjR2MtMVJ2Qy0yNFNMR3hBZ0JGU2g5T0dHenVsX3N2X1V2bjdSOGJWdE40eVhxNDBvdmNyNUdoOUFmRmhCd2h4MWUwMTZqNXh4d2dsY0xDOXMtb1IyZUxiOS13bnBvT3dBckc